ac_lin_two: F32 (R97): an RC low-pass swept linearly over one interval, 1 kHz to 2 kHz (points=1): VACASK runs both ends, the ngspice deck written for it (.ac lin 2 1e3 2e3) runs 1 kHz alone (acan.c: a linear sweep of two points has no step), so the grid changes
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0 mag=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=1u
control
  analysis ac1 ac from=1e3 to=2e3 mode="lin" points=1
endc
